# Independently authored ALTER FUNCTION + ALTER
# PROCEDURE + lo_import/lo_export sentinel slice for
# the GPL MTR-format runner. NOT copied or adapted
# from MySQL's mysql-test/.
#
# Existing coverage (do NOT duplicate):
#   - ALTER FUNCTION / ALTER PROCEDURE (all forms):
#     ZERO prior coverage.
#   - lo_import / lo_export: ZERO prior coverage.
#
# Pre-existing rejection shape patterns:
#   - "ALTER restricted-list" — "Expected: one of VIEW
#     or TYPE or TABLE or INDEX or ROLE or POLICY or
#     CONNECTOR or ICEBERG or SCHEMA or USER or OPERATOR,
#     found: <KW>" at col 7. Pre-existing at event_use_
#     partition_sentinel:6,8 (EVENT), sequence_basic_
#     extra:116, and PR #395 (DEFAULT).
#   - "unknown function: lo_<X>" — pre-existing at
#     PR #391 (lo_create, lo_open, lo_unlink).
#
# This slice pins (per-keyword surface application —
# both shape patterns are pre-existing):
#
#   ALTER restricted-list — ALTER FUNCTION (9 forms):
#     - RENAME TO, OWNER TO, SET search_path, IMMUTABLE,
#       STABLE, VOLATILE, STRICT, SECURITY DEFINER,
#       RESET search_path
#     - All hit "found: FUNCTION" at col 7 — sqlparser's
#       ALTER dispatcher doesn't accept FUNCTION as an
#       object-type. The downstream clause (RENAME/OWNER/
#       SET/IMMUTABLE/etc.) is never reached.
#
#   ALTER restricted-list — ALTER PROCEDURE (3 forms):
#     - RENAME TO, OWNER TO, SECURITY INVOKER
#     - All hit "found: PROCEDURE" at col 7 — same shape,
#       new keyword.
#
#   "unknown function: lo_<X>" — lo_import / lo_export
#   (3 forms):
#     - lo_import(path), lo_import(path, oid), lo_export
#       (oid, path) — all unknown. Adds lo_import and
#       lo_export to the lo_* unknown-function bucket
#       alongside PR #391's lo_create/lo_open/lo_unlink.
#
# Big-picture finding:
#
#   ALTER FUNCTION and ALTER PROCEDURE are entirely
#   unreachable in zeta — sqlparser doesn't accept
#   FUNCTION/PROCEDURE in its ALTER restricted-list,
#   so no variant ever reaches the executor. Same
#   shape as ALTER DEFAULT PRIVILEGES from PR #395 and
#   ALTER EVENT from event_use_partition_sentinel.
#
#   PG large-object I/O (lo_import file → oid, lo_export
#   oid → file) is also unreachable. Apps porting PG
#   code that uses lo_* for blob storage must rewrite
#   to BYTEA storage with application-side file I/O.
#
# Adaptation notes:
#   # zeta-adapt: KNOWN GAP — ALTER FUNCTION (any form)
#     and ALTER PROCEDURE (any form) all error 1064 at
#     ALTER restricted-list ("found: FUNCTION/PROCEDURE"
#     at col 7). No substitute — drop from migration
#     scripts.
#   # zeta-adapt: KNOWN GAP — lo_import / lo_export
#     unknown function. PG large-object I/O has no
#     equivalent — use BYTEA + app-side file I/O.

--echo === ALTER FUNCTION (9 forms) — ALTER restricted-list "found: FUNCTION" at col 7 ===

--error 1064
ALTER FUNCTION foo() RENAME TO bar;
--error 1064
ALTER FUNCTION foo(int) OWNER TO bob;
--error 1064
ALTER FUNCTION foo() SET search_path = public;
--error 1064
ALTER FUNCTION foo() IMMUTABLE;
--error 1064
ALTER FUNCTION foo() STABLE;
--error 1064
ALTER FUNCTION foo() VOLATILE;
--error 1064
ALTER FUNCTION foo() STRICT;
--error 1064
ALTER FUNCTION foo() SECURITY DEFINER;
--error 1064
ALTER FUNCTION foo() RESET search_path;

--echo === ALTER PROCEDURE (3 forms) — ALTER restricted-list "found: PROCEDURE" at col 7 ===

--error 1064
ALTER PROCEDURE proc1() RENAME TO new_proc;
--error 1064
ALTER PROCEDURE proc1() OWNER TO bob;
--error 1064
ALTER PROCEDURE proc1() SECURITY INVOKER;

--echo === lo_import / lo_export — unknown function (joins PR #391 lo_* bucket) ===

--error 1105
SELECT lo_import('/tmp/file.bin');
--error 1105
SELECT lo_import('/tmp/file.bin', 12345);
--error 1105
SELECT lo_export(12345, '/tmp/out.bin');
